@startuml r-04-release-gate
' Copyright 2026 Muhammad Salah
' SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
title Release gate — 0.0.1

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #8A8D90
  FontColor #151515
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F0F0
  DiamondBorderColor #8A8D90
}
skinparam ArrowColor #0066CC

start
:All eight phases meet their exit criteria;
:Cut  release/0.0.1  from main;

fork
  :**Correctness**
  round trip on rich and federated
  auth continuity: password, OTP, token signature
  capture parity across all four targets
  BlobStore contract green on four backends;
fork again
  :**Do no harm**
  serving workload untouched
  label trap · teardown on five paths
  leak sweep clean;
fork again
  :**Secrets**
  redaction stage green
  index schema holds no secret
  unencrypted bundle labelled in three places
  reveal audited, never logged;
fork again
  :**Resilience**
  fault-injection matrix green
  resume across restart converges
  breaker opens, reports, recovers;
end fork

:Full matrix run
including nightly-only and manual-only targets;
:Manual walkthrough on three platforms
empty config to completed round trip, recorded;

if (every gate item has evidence?) then (no)
  :Blocked. Fix on the release branch.;
  detach
else (yes)
endif

:Sign and notarise four artifacts
publish SHA256SUMS;
:Tag  v0.0.1  signed;
:Merge back to main with ~--no-ff;
stop

note right
  "Ship it and fix in 0.0.2"
  is not available on any of
  these items. Each one guards
  against losing credentials.
end note

@enduml
